<p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details v-show="!embedded" class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;nav class=\&quot;l-spy-nav\&quot; aria-label=\&quot;Example sections\&quot;&gt;&lt;button v-for=\&quot;item in [&#x27;Home&#x27;,&#x27;Details&#x27;,&#x27;Summary&#x27;]\&quot; :key=\&quot;item\&quot; :aria-current=\&quot;menuSection===item?&#x27;location&#x27;:undefined\&quot; @click=\&quot;menuSection=item\&quot;&gt;{{item}}&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-card\&quot; aria-live=\&quot;polite\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{{menuSection}}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;Section {{menuSection.toLowerCase()}} selected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a section-selection preview, not automatic scroll tracking. Production scrollspy should use IntersectionObserver to update aria-current.&lt;/p&gt;\n&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="notifications" class="kit-section" v-show="showSection('notifications') && (!catalogSearch || &quot;notifications&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase()))"><h2>Notifications</h2><p>A persistent inbox for events that need attention, distinct from short-lived toasts.</p>
<div class="l-demo"><div class="l-actions"><strong>Notifications</strong><span class="badge text-bg-secondary">{{notificationsRead?0:2}} unread</span><button class="btn-outline theme-secondary" @click="notificationsRead=!notificationsRead">{{notificationsRead?'Reset unread':'Mark all read'}}</button></div><ul class="l-list"><li><span>{{notificationsRead?'Read':'Unread'}} · Dana requested a project review</span><small>4 minutes ago</small></li><li><span>{{notificationsRead?'Read':'Unread'}} · Budget approved</span><small>1 hour ago</small></li></ul></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details v-show="!embedded" class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo\&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;l-badge\&quot;&gt;{{notificationsRead?0:2}} unread&lt;/span&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;notificationsRead=!notificationsRead\&quot;&gt;{{notificationsRead?&#x27;Reset unread&#x27;:&#x27;Mark all read&#x27;}}&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=\&quot;l-list\&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{notificationsRead?&#x27;Read&#x27;:&#x27;Unread&#x27;}} \u00b7 Dana requested a project review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;small&gt;4 minutes ago&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;{{notificationsRead?&#x27;Read&#x27;:&#x27;Unread&#x27;}} \u00b7 Budget approved&lt;/span&gt;&lt;small&gt;1 hour ago&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="attachment" class="kit-section" v-show="showSection('attachment') && (!catalogSearch || &quot;attachment and file upload&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase()))"><h2>Attachment and file upload</h2><p>Native file selection, filename and size. This preview never uploads a file.</p>
