<div class="l-demo l-form"><label>Budget (USD)<div class="l-actions"><span>$</span><input type="number" min="0" value="1200"><button class="btn-outline theme-secondary" @click="showToast('Demo budget updated','success')">Apply</button></div></label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details v-show="!embedded" class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Budget (USD)&lt;div class=\&quot;l-actions\&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;number\&quot; min=\&quot;0\&quot; value=\&quot;1200\&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; @click=\&quot;showToast(&#x27;Demo budget updated&#x27;,&#x27;success&#x27;)\&quot;&gt;Apply&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="validation" class="kit-section" v-show="showSection('validation') && (!catalogSearch || &quot;validation and field states&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase()))"><h2>Validation and field states</h2><p>Validate after interaction, preserve entered values, and connect errors to the field.</p>
<div class="l-demo l-form"><form @submit.prevent="formSent=true" novalidate><label>Project name<input v-model="formName" required :aria-invalid="formSent&&!formName.trim()" aria-describedby="kit-validation"></label><small id="kit-validation" role="status">{{formSent?(formName.trim()?'Demo saved':'Enter a project name'):'Use a short unique name'}}</small><label>Read-only reference<input value="PRJ-042" readonly></label><label>Disabled field<input value="Managed by workspace" disabled></label><button class="btn-outline theme-secondary" type="submit">Validate demo</button></form></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details v-show="!embedded" class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;form @submit.prevent=\&quot;formSent=true\&quot; novalidate&gt;&lt;label&gt;Project name&lt;input v-model=\&quot;formName\&quot; required :aria-invalid=\&quot;formSent&amp;&amp;!formName.trim()\&quot; aria-describedby=\&quot;kit-validation\&quot;&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;small id=\&quot;kit-validation\&quot; role=\&quot;status\&quot;&gt;{{formSent?(formName.trim()?&#x27;Demo saved&#x27;:&#x27;Enter a project name&#x27;):&#x27;Use a short unique name&#x27;}}&lt;/small&gt;&lt;label&gt;Read-only reference&lt;input value=\&quot;PRJ-042\&quot; readonly&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;Disabled field&lt;input value=\&quot;Managed by workspace\&quot; disabled&gt;&lt;/label&gt;&lt;button class=\&quot;l-btn l-secondary\&quot; type=\&quot;submit\&quot;&gt;Validate demo&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="error-state" class="kit-section" v-show="showSection('error-state') && (!catalogSearch || &quot;error and retry&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase()))"><h2>Error and 