<div class="l-demo l-form"><label><input type="checkbox" checked> Email updates</label><label><input type="checkbox" disabled> Managed option (disabled)</label><fieldset><legend>Plan</legend><label><input type="radio" name="kit-plan" checked> Personal</label><label><input type="radio" name="kit-plan"> Team</label></fieldset><label class="l-switch"><input type="checkbox" role="switch" checked><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Automatic reminders</label></div><p class="kit-note"><strong>Keyboard:</strong> Tab to interactive controls. Enter activates buttons and links; Space toggles native choices. Disabled controls cannot be activated. Use Escape to close modal surfaces.</p><details v-show="!embedded" class="kit-code"><summary>Copy implementation markup</summary><pre><code v-text="&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;l-demo l-form\&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; checked&gt; Email updates&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; disabled&gt; Managed option (disabled)&lt;/label&gt;&lt;fieldset&gt;&lt;legend&gt;Plan&lt;/legend&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;kit-plan\&quot; checked&gt; Personal&lt;/label&gt;&lt;label&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;radio\&quot; name=\&quot;kit-plan\&quot;&gt; Team&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/fieldset&gt;&lt;label class=\&quot;l-switch\&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=\&quot;checkbox\&quot; role=\&quot;switch\&quot; checked&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=\&quot;true\&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Automatic reminders&lt;/label&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;"></code></pre></details></section><section id="avatar" class="kit-section" v-show="showSection('avatar') && (!catalogSearch || &quot;avatar&quot;.includes(catalogSearch.toLowerCase()))"><h2>Avatar</h2><p>Initials fallback and text status. Noninteractive avatars do not need a tab stop.</p>
